{#
  Block         logo-marquee
  Role          Credibility — the client logo strip
  Kind          fragment (needs a section wrapper)
  Surface       inherits
  Motion        CSS marquee, 40s linear infinite, pauses on hover, flattened by reduced-motion
  Data          /assets/logos/*.png, t.home.logos.*Alt
  Anchor        none
  Styles        logo-marquee.css, plus _shared/foundations.css, _shared/section.css, _shared/motion.css, _shared/reduced-motion.css, _shared/responsive.css
  Known issues  Logo files are not in every branding directory. Six tiles are duplicated with aria-hidden to make the loop seamless — a different count needs the duplicate set and the -50% keyframe kept in step.
  Copied from   src/pages/index.njk lines 74-89, at repo version 0.2.1
#}
